{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"Cato doesn't look great. He looks worn. His cloak is in tatters. His arm continues to scar. \"I am sorry Wynne. I was a really shitty friend yesterday. I hope to become better. I hope you will forgive me, as I am learning to forgive myself.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T21:37:26.254000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741047308141068390","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
