{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"Cato nods sadly. \"I gave up my knight name. Now I am just Sir Cato. I hope I can earn it back, while I earn your forgiveness as well.\" He bows deeply. \"Sorry Wynne.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T21:45:27.682000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741049327396585584","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"They look at him silently for a moment, thinking. Then they hold up the journal and the key to the shop. “Here, I’ll give you a test. To earn my trust back as well as theirs.” They kind of gesture to the surrounding area.","created_at":"2020-08-06T21:48:00.648000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741049968982360165","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
