{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"“I’m going to place this journal in your care, and you should ask me about it every time you see me.” They sound a little paranoid. “If I ever seem to not know about it, I’m trusting you to return it to me. To the chest in my shop.”","created_at":"2020-08-06T21:51:58.658000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741050967268786177","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
