{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"They pause. “I want to keep my family safe. That’s all. But this is a precaution I’m taking.”","created_at":"2020-08-06T21:56:28.181000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741052097729921074","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
